    "%lld 种在 eBird 名录里没有对应英文名，只写学名；上传时可能需要在 Fix Species 里手动对应。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld species have no English name in the eBird taxonomy and are written with the scientific name only; you may need to match them by hand under Fix Species when uploading."
