    "BirdNET+ Geomodel v3.0.4：直接使用官方发布的模型。geomodel 仓库 LICENSE-MODELS.md 写 Apache-2.0，但 birdnet pip README 写 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0，两者冲突，需由所有者决定依据哪项声明。请引用 BirdNET。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "BirdNET+ Geomodel v3.0.4: the officially released model, used as is. The geomodel repository’s LICENSE-MODELS.md says Apache-2.0, but the birdnet pip README says CC BY-NC-SA 4.0; the two conflict, and the owner has to decide which statement applies. Please cite BirdNET."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "BirdNET+ Geomodel v3.0.4：直接使用官方发布的模型。geomodel 仓库 LICENSE-MODELS.md 写 Apache-2.0，但 birdnet pip README 写 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0，两者冲突，需由所有者决定依据哪项声明。请引用 BirdNET。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
