    "GBIF.org (17 November 2026) GBIF Occurrence Download / search API。观测记录数不是鸟的实际数量。受威胁等级：IUCN (2026). The IUCN Red List of Threatened Species. Version 2026-1. https://www.iucnredlist.org，经 GBIF 发布，doi:10.15468/0qnb58，CC BY 4.0（creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0）。有改动：只保留鸟类的全球等级代码，并按学名匹配到 AviList v2026，少数鸟种未能匹配而不显示等级；IUCN 与 GBIF 不为本应用背书。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GBIF.org (17 November 2026) GBIF Occurrence Download / search API. Record counts are not the actual number of birds. Threat categories: IUCN (2026). The IUCN Red List of Threatened Species. Version 2026-1. https://www.iucnredlist.org, published through GBIF, doi:10.15468/0qnb58, CC BY 4.0 (creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0). Changes: only the global category codes of birds are kept, matched to AviList v2026 by scientific name; a few species could not be matched and show no category. IUCN and GBIF do not endorse this app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GBIF.org (17 November 2026) GBIF Occurrence Download / search API。观测记录数不是鸟的实际数量。受威胁等级：IUCN (2026). The IUCN Red List of Threatened Species. Version 2026-1. https://www.iucnredlist.org，经 GBIF 发布，doi:10.15468/0qnb58，CC BY 4.0（creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0）。有改动：只保留鸟类的全球等级代码，并按学名匹配到 AviList v2026，少数鸟种未能匹配而不显示等级；IUCN 与 GBIF 不为本应用背书。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
