    "关闭。选好文件夹（“我的 iPhone”或 iCloud 云盘等）后，App 回到前台时如果记录有变化、且距上次成功备份满 24 小时，会自动写一份新备份；只保留本应用在那里写的最近 3 份。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off. Once you choose a folder (On My iPhone, iCloud Drive, etc.), whenever the app returns to the foreground with changed records and at least 24 hours since the last successful backup, it writes a new backup automatically; only the latest 3 backups this app wrote there are kept."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭。选好文件夹（“我的 iPhone”或 iCloud 云盘等）后，App 回到前台时如果记录有变化、且距上次成功备份满 24 小时，会自动写一份新备份；只保留本应用在那里写的最近 3 份。"
          }
        }
