    "加载": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Load"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "加载"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "加载为建立模型用时；首次、预热为每次预测用时；峰值为加载与预测期间比开始时多出的内存；余弦为 BioCLIP 输出与 CPU 的最低一致性（1 = 相同）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Load is the time to build the model; first and warm are the time per prediction; peak is the memory above the starting level during load and prediction; cosine is the lowest agreement of the BioCLIP output with the CPU (1 = identical)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "加载为建立模型用时；首次、预热为每次预测用时；峰值为加载与预测期间比开始时多出的内存；余弦为 BioCLIP 输出与 CPU 的最低一致性（1 = 相同）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
