            "state": "translated",
            "value": "圆圈是你的地点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "圆点数字 = 该处照片位置涉及的不同观察记录数。底图来自 Apple 地图，需要网络；没有网络时下面的列表照常可用。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Number on a dot = how many different observations have photos at that spot. The base map is Apple Maps and needs a network; without one, the list below still works."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "圆点数字 = 该处照片位置涉及的不同观察记录数。底图来自 Apple 地图，需要网络；没有网络时下面的列表照常可用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
