    },
    "在照片上拖出包含鸟的矩形；有选中的鸟时替换它的框，更正保留。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drag a rectangle around the bird on the photo; if a bird is selected, its box is replaced and the correction is kept."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在照片上拖出包含鸟的矩形；有选中的鸟时替换它的框，更正保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在照片上画框，或使用整张照片重试。这张照片仍保留在记录里，不计入鸟种。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Draw a box on the photo, or try again with the whole photo. The photo stays in your records but does not count as a species."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在照片上画框，或使用整张照片重试。这张照片仍保留在记录里，不计入鸟种。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在线物种资料（Wikipedia / Wikimedia / iNaturalist）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Online species references (Wikipedia / Wikimedia / iNaturalist)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在线物种资料（Wikipedia / Wikimedia / iNaturalist）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在线资料会把你打开的鸟种对应的 Wikipedia 条目名、Wikidata 编号和 Commons 文件名发送给 Wikipedia / Wikimedia，只在打开物种页时发送；列表里的物种缩略图会把该鸟种的 iNaturalist 分类编号发送给 iNaturalist。不会发送你的照片、拍摄信息、观察记录、位置或输入的搜索词。网站也会接收到网络连接所需的 IP 地址等信息。关闭后仍可离线搜索、查看自己的记录和已经缓存的资料；可在“设置”里删除网络缓存。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Online references send the Wikipedia article name, Wikidata ID and Commons file name of the species you open to Wikipedia / Wikimedia, only when you open a species page; species thumbnails in lists send that species’ iNaturalist taxon ID to iNaturalist. Your photos, shooting details, observations, location and search terms are never sent. The sites also receive what a network connection needs, such as your IP address. When this is off you can still search offline and view your own records and already cached references; the network cache can be deleted in Settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在线资料会把你打开的鸟种对应的 Wikipedia 条目名、Wikidata 编号和 Commons 文件名发送给 Wikipedia / Wikimedia，只在打开物种页时发送；列表里的物种缩略图会把该鸟种的 iNaturalist 分类编号发送给 iNaturalist。不会发送你的照片、拍摄信息、观察记录、位置或输入的搜索词。网站也会接收到网络连接所需的 IP 地址等信息。关闭后仍可离线搜索、查看自己的记录和已经缓存的资料；可在“设置”里删除网络缓存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在线资料已关闭：不会联网，只显示已经缓存的资料。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Online references are off: nothing goes online, only cached references are shown."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在线资料已关闭：不会联网，只显示已经缓存的资料。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在线资料已关闭；打开后才会联网取": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
