    "地点模型没有这个物种，无法画分布。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The place model does not have this species, so no range can be drawn."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地点模型没有这个物种，无法画分布。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "地点模型（BirdNET）在 %lld° 网格上的估计，颜色越浓越可能出现，不是观测记录。全年取 12 个月中最高；繁殖季 = 北半球 5–7 月、南半球 11–1 月，非繁殖季 = 北半球 12–2 月、南半球 6–8 月（按格点所在半球，热带只是近似）。%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Place model (BirdNET) estimate on a %1$lld° grid; the deeper the colour, the more likely the bird. These are not observation records. All year takes the highest of the 12 months; breeding = May–Jul in the northern hemisphere, Nov–Jan in the southern; non-breeding = Dec–Feb north, Jun–Aug south (by each cell’s hemisphere; only approximate in the tropics). %2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地点模型（BirdNET）在 %1$lld° 网格上的估计，颜色越浓越可能出现，不是观测记录。全年取 12 个月中最高；繁殖季 = 北半球 5–7 月、南半球 11–1 月，非繁殖季 = 北半球 12–2 月、南半球 6–8 月（按格点所在半球，热带只是近似）。%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
