    "定位用于判断附近当季的鸟；大致位置就够了，照片不会上传。地图搜索、浏览和地名由 Apple 提供（只发送坐标）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Location is used to judge which birds are around in this season; a rough position is enough, and photos are never uploaded. Map search, browsing and place names are provided by Apple (only coordinates are sent)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "定位用于判断附近当季的鸟；大致位置就够了，照片不会上传。地图搜索、浏览和地名由 Apple 提供（只发送坐标）。"
