    "导出为 eBird 的 Record Format 文件，需要你自己在 eBird 网站上传核对；不会自动提交。默认“偶遇（Incidental）”、非完整清单、数量 X，不编造观鸟时长和距离。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Exports an eBird Record Format file that you upload and check on the eBird website yourself; nothing is submitted automatically. Defaults: Incidental, not a complete checklist, count X; birding duration and distance are not made up."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导出为 eBird 的 Record Format 文件，需要你自己在 eBird 网站上传核对；不会自动提交。默认“偶遇（Incidental）”、非完整清单、数量 X，不编造观鸟时长和距离。"
