    "开始识别": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Identify"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开始识别"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开源代码 MIT。识别离线运行，照片与历史仅保存在设备。系统 PhotosPicker 无需授予整个相册权限。所有模型随安装包提供；只有 Apple 地图搜索、瓦片和地名（开启“用网络显示地名”时只发送坐标），以及物种页的在线物种资料（开启“在线物种资料”时只把该鸟种的 Wikipedia 条目名、Wikidata 编号和 Commons 文件名发给 Wikipedia / Wikimedia；列表缩略图只把该鸟种的 iNaturalist 分类编号发给 iNaturalist）和“检查更新（GitHub）”（默认关闭；开启后每天最多一次向 GitHub 查询最新正式版的版本号，不发送当前版本号或设备信息）联网；不向我们上传照片、坐标或结果。Apple 获取地图浏览区域以提供瓦片。在线简介按 CC BY-SA 4.0，参考图按各自的 Commons 许可，列表缩略图是 iNaturalist 分类默认照片、按各自的 CC 许可（长按查看作者与许可），署名与许可显示在图文旁。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open source, MIT. Identification runs offline; photos and history stay on this device. The system PhotosPicker needs no access to your whole library. All models ship with the app; only Apple map search, tiles and place names (coordinates only, when “Place names from the network” is on) and the online species references on species pages (when “Online species references” is on, only that species’ Wikipedia article name, Wikidata ID and Commons file name go to Wikipedia / Wikimedia; list thumbnails send only its iNaturalist taxon ID to iNaturalist) and “Check for updates (GitHub)” (off by default; when on, at most once a day it asks GitHub for the latest release’s version number, sending neither the current version nor device details) use the network. No photos, coordinates or results are uploaded to us. Apple receives the map area you browse to provide tiles. Online summaries are CC BY-SA 4.0, reference images carry their own Commons licences, and list thumbnails are iNaturalist taxon default photos under their own CC licences (long-press for author and licence); credits and licences are shown next to them."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开源代码 MIT。识别离线运行，照片与历史仅保存在设备。系统 PhotosPicker 无需授予整个相册权限。所有模型随安装包提供；只有 Apple 地图搜索、瓦片和地名（开启“用网络显示地名”时只发送坐标），以及物种页的在线物种资料（开启“在线物种资料”时只把该鸟种的 Wikipedia 条目名、Wikidata 编号和 Commons 文件名发给 Wikipedia / Wikimedia；列表缩略图只把该鸟种的 iNaturalist 分类编号发给 iNaturalist）和“检查更新（GitHub）”（默认关闭；开启后每天最多一次向 GitHub 查询最新正式版的版本号，不发送当前版本号或设备信息）联网；不向我们上传照片、坐标或结果。Apple 获取地图浏览区域以提供瓦片。在线简介按 CC BY-SA 4.0，参考图按各自的 Commons 许可，列表缩略图是 iNaturalist 分类默认照片、按各自的 CC 许可（长按查看作者与许可），署名与许可显示在图文旁。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
