    "按 GBIF 观测记录的当地当月份额分级；记录数不是实际种群数量。覆盖不足的地区显示数据不足。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Graded by the local share of GBIF observation records this month; record counts are not actual population size. Regions with too little coverage show insufficient data."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按 GBIF 观测记录的当地当月份额分级；记录数不是实际种群数量。覆盖不足的地区显示数据不足。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
