      }
    },
    "用随 App 附带的 4 张 CC0 照片，逐个模型、逐个计算单元设置（all / CPU+ANE / CPU+GPU / CPU）测加载、首次与预热后单次预测用时和峰值内存，另测 48 MP 照片的预处理。不读写你的记录，不改设置。约需 1–3 分钟（首次用神经网络引擎时系统要编译模型），请保持在本页并截图发给开发者。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uses the 4 CC0 photos bundled with the app to measure, per model and per compute unit setting (all / CPU+ANE / CPU+GPU / CPU), load time, first and warm single-prediction time and peak memory, plus preprocessing of a 48 MP photo. Does not read or write your records or change settings. Takes about 1–3 minutes (the system compiles the models the first time the Neural Engine is used); stay on this page and send a screenshot to the developer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用随 App 附带的 4 张 CC0 照片，逐个模型、逐个计算单元设置（all / CPU+ANE / CPU+GPU / CPU）测加载、首次与预热后单次预测用时和峰值内存，另测 48 MP 照片的预处理。不读写你的记录，不改设置。约需 1–3 分钟（首次用神经网络引擎时系统要编译模型），请保持在本页并截图发给开发者。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
