    "这个框里大约有几只（1–999998），适合一个框框住一群鸟。估计数量：同日同地点取单张照片的最大值；可能重复见到同一只鸟。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About how many birds are in this box (1–999998), for a box around a flock. Estimated count: the largest count in a single photo for the same day and place; the same bird may be seen more than once."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个框里大约有几只（1–999998），适合一个框框住一群鸟。估计数量：同日同地点取单张照片的最大值；可能重复见到同一只鸟。"
