    "这些旧文件无法读取，已原样保存在记录库里，也随备份导出；修复前不计入统计。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These old files cannot be read; they are kept as is in the record store and exported with backups, and are not counted until repaired."
          }
