    "首次安装或升级后完整计算一次 SHA-256，之后只核对文件大小（App 包有系统代码签名保护）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SHA-256 is computed in full once after install or upgrade; after that only file sizes are checked (the app package is protected by the system code signature)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
