    "默认关闭。开启后每天最多一次向 GitHub 查询最新正式版的版本号，不发送 cookie、设备信息或当前版本号；有新版时在这里给出发布页链接，不自动下载或安装。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off by default. When on, at most once a day the app asks GitHub for the latest release’s version number, sending no cookies, device details or current version; when there is a newer one, a link to the Releases page appears here. Nothing is downloaded or installed automatically."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认关闭。开启后每天最多一次向 GitHub 查询最新正式版的版本号，不发送 cookie、设备信息或当前版本号；有新版时在这里给出发布页链接，不自动下载或安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "默认取同日同地点单张照片的最大值，可能重复见到同一只鸟。可以改成你的估计（可以小于单张最大值）。改日期、地点或鸟种后，这个数不会跟到新的分组。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "By default the largest count in a single photo for the same day and place; the same bird may be seen more than once. You can change it to your own estimate (it can be lower than the single-photo maximum). After changing the date, place or species, this number does not follow to the new group."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "默认取同日同地点单张照片的最大值，可能重复见到同一只鸟。可以改成你的估计（可以小于单张最大值）。改日期、地点或鸟种后，这个数不会跟到新的分组。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
